          "is_alternative": false
        },
        {
          "id": "9702_s16_21_q01_b_mp04",
          "text": "∆ρ / ρ = 2(0.01/0.38) + (0.1/25.0) + (0.001/0.225) [= 0.061] or %ρ = 5.3% + 0.40% + 0.44% (= 6.1%)",
