        },
        {
          "id": "9702_s16_21_q01_b_mp05",
          "text": "∆ρ = 0.061 × 7940 = 480 (kg m–3) density = (7.9 ± 0.5) × 103 kg m–3 or (7900 ± 500) kg m–3",
